+### RPC Signature
+```sql
+CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION public.post_order_payment_atomic(
+  p_order_id           UUID,
+  p_idempotency_key    TEXT,
+  p_payments           JSONB,
+  p_allocations        JSONB    DEFAULT NULL,
+  p_business_date      DATE     DEFAULT NULL,
+  p_external_reference TEXT     DEFAULT NULL,
